WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.592
Seven and three are number partners. They fill ten spaces.

00:00:04.450 --> 00:00:06.349
Seven plus three equals ten.

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:10.647
Double four means four added to four.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:15.885
Double four is eight. Learn doubles to calculate quickly.
